# ---- PAD-1327 (emulator-proven 2026-11-16: entry on the menu, picked, game 1 played as Competition): the start menu (CHOOSE YOUR MODE OF PLAY), a menu of game-mode table indices read off this program's
# own menu function 0x4cb3f0; the frame point `ldr w24, [x0, w21, sxtw #2]`: the index under the cursor once the press has moved it (w21), the list sp+0xd8 (room for 12: 0x108 is the next object), the count at sp+136 and the loop's copy of the last index at sp+140.
# Prolonged Competition (comp.cfg) appends Competition's index again and letters its name message while the cursor
# is on it; the game itself plays the pick as Competition (Standard's index once it is on).
site comp_menu_frame     0x004cc050 0xb875d818 0x6b18039f
value comp_menu_frame_moved      1
value comp_menu_frame_list_at    216
value comp_menu_frame_count_at   136
